=====[[Goh's Sobble]]=====
Sobble debuted in ''[[JN027|Toughing It Out!]]'', where it briefly observed {{Ash}} and [[Goh]]'s {{pkmn|training}}. In ''[[JN028|Sobbing Sobble!]]'', Goh {{pkmn2|caught}} it, and it joined his [[Party|team]]. In ''[[JN062|Not Too Close for Comfort!]]'', it evolved into {{p|Drizzile}}, which later evolved into {{p|Inteleon}} in ''[[JN078|Detective Drizzile!]]''.

====Minor appearances====
A Sobble appeared in a fantasy alongside the other [[first partner Pokémon]] in ''[[JN046|Getting More Than You Battled For!]]''.

In ''[[JN139|Must Be Our Heroes and the Witch!]]'', a Sobble appeared in a fantasy.

A Trainer's Sobble appeared in ''[[HZ019|The Bittersweet Truth]]''.

A Sobble appeared in ''[[HZ057|The Terapagos I Don't Know]]'', under the ownership of a student.

A Student's Sobble appeared in ''[[HZ089|Where the Adventure Leads]]''.

